    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town uniquely hosts the only intersection of the TransAmerica Bicycle Trail with U.S. Route 66, drawing cyclists from coast to coast.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marshfield%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A replica of the Hubble Space Telescope stands proudly in front of the Webster County Courthouse, honoring the hometown of Edwin Hubble.",
